# Mate puzzles: "# mate <n> <name>" followed by the position as a G line.
# mate 7 Nikita, white to move endgame puzzle 2 (mate in 7 or less)
G 1 size 8x8 odd fen [k7/p*n6/K7/8/8/8/6P*B/8:0:1:w]
# mate 2 same without the pawn, bishop on g2 (mates through time: Bc6 Kb8 Bxb7)
G 1 size 8x8 odd fen [k*7/p*n6/K*7/8/8/8/6B/8:0:1:w]
